          "type": "tip",
          "text_md": "**Forma corta**: I'm, You're, He's, She's, It's, We're, They're. Es la forma más natural al hablar."
        },
        {
          "type": "common_error",
          "text_md": "**No olvides el verbo to be**: ✗ *I wearing a shirt.* → ✓ *I'm wearing a shirt.*"
        }
      ],
      "common_errors_es": [
        "Olvidar el verbo to be: ✗ I wearing a shirt. → ✓ I'm wearing a shirt.",
        "Usar el presente simple en lugar del continuo: ✗ I wear a shirt now. → ✓ I'm wearing a shirt now.",
        "Olvidar la -ing al final del verbo: ✗ I'm wear a shirt. → ✓ I'm wearing a shirt."
